  "id": "92d34b9c2f",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hub-section hub-overview\" id=\"fitout-hub-overview\"><div class=\"wrap hub-overview-grid\">\n      <figure class=\"hub-image hub-overview-media\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Wide office interior showing coordinated ceiling, lighting, partitions and furniture\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"hub-caption\">One coordinated build · From services to furniture</figcaption></figure>\n      <div class=\"hub-overview-copy\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"hub-tag\">What fit-out covers</p><h2>A complete build, coordinated under one team</h2><p class=\"lead\">Fit-out turns an empty or unfinished interior into a space ready to use.</p><p>Woodex coordinates the structure, services, finishes, joinery and furniture through one BOQ, one site programme and one final handover.</p><div class=\"hub-feature-lines\"><div class=\"hub-feature-line\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 27V7h22v20M5 13h22M12 13v14M21 13v14\"></path></svg><strong>Partitions &amp; ceilings</strong><span>Rooms, cabins and overhead systems.</span></div><div class=\"hub-feature-line\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 3-9 15h7l-2 11 9-16h-7l2-10Z\"></path></svg><strong>MEP services</strong><span>Electrical, lighting, plumbing and AC.</span></div><div class=\"hub-feature-line\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 7h22v18H5zM5 14h22M16 14v11M10 19h2M21 19h2\"></path></svg><strong>Joinery &amp; furniture</strong><span>Counters, workstations and storage.</span></div><div class=\"hub-feature-line\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 5h13l5 5v17H7zM20 5v6h6M11 17h10M11 22h7\"></path></svg><strong>Final finishes</strong><span>Flooring, paint, fixtures and snagging.</span></div></div></div>\n    </div></section>"
 },
