  "type": "process",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hub-section hub-dark\" id=\"fitout-hub-process\"><div class=\"wrap hub-process-layout\">\n      <div class=\"hub-process-sticky\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"hub-tag\">A controlled build</p><h2>Six clear steps to handover</h2><p class=\"lead\">Scope, cost and sequence are agreed before site work starts.</p><figure class=\"hub-image hub-process-image\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-dce06249b137.webp\" alt=\"Woodex project exterior representing coordinated construction delivery\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"hub-caption\">Programme, procurement and site delivery</figcaption></figure></div>\n      <div class=\"hub-process-list\" data-hub-process=\"\"><article class=\"hub-step is-active\"><h3>Survey</h3><p>We review the shell, services, access and building rules.</p></article><article class=\"hub-step is-active\"><h3>Coordinate</h3><p>Layouts and technical details are checked for buildability.</p></article><article class=\"hub-step is-active\"><h3>Price</h3><p>An itemized BOQ sets the agreed scope and budget.</p></article><article class=\"hub-step is-active\"><h3>Procure</h3><p>Materials are approved and sequenced for site.</p></article><article class=\"hub-step is-active\"><h3>Build</h3><p>Trades work through one managed construction programme.</p></article><article class=\"hub-step is-active\"><h3>Handover</h3><p>We snag, test, clean and hand over the finished space.</p></article></div>\n    </div></section>",
