  "id": "c73b24c5a7",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hub-section\" id=\"fitout-hub-projects\"><div class=\"wrap\"><header class=\"hub-head\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><h2>Spaces shaped around the operation</h2><p>Three commercial settings, each planned around how the space needs to work.</p></header><div class=\"hub-projects-grid\"><article class=\"hub-project\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Office fit-out project image placeholder\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"hub-project-copy\"><small>Office fit-out</small><h3>Workplace built for focus and flow</h3></div></article><article class=\"hub-project\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Retail showroom fit-out project image placeholder\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"hub-project-copy\"><small>Retail fit-out</small><h3>Display, lighting and movement</h3></div></article><article class=\"hub-project\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" alt=\"Restaurant fit-out project image placeholder\" width=\"2240\" height=\"1120\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"hub-project-copy\"><small>Hospitality fit-out</small><h3>Front of house and service flow</h3></div></article></div></div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "b4ef01d157",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hub-section\" id=\"fitout-hub-pricing\"><div class=\"wrap hub-pricing-layout\">\n      <div class=\"hub-pricing-copy\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"hub-tag\">Indicative PKR ranges</p><h2>Fit-out pricing, without the mystery</h2><p class=\"lead\">Site condition, area and specification set the final cost.</p><div class=\"hub-price-list\"><div class=\"hub-price-row\"><strong>Office Fit-Out · 1,000 sq. ft.</strong><span>PKR 1.5M to 3.5M</span></div><div class=\"hub-price-row\"><strong>Commercial Fit-Out · 1,000 sq. ft.</strong><span>PKR 2M to 4.5M</span></div><div class=\"hub-price-row\"><strong>Retail Fit-Out · 500 sq. ft.</strong><span>PKR 1M to 2.5M</span></div></div><p class=\"hub-price-note\">These are planning ranges. A site survey and itemized BOQ establish the reliable project price.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#fitout-hub-contact\">Request a Fit-Out Quote</a></div>\n      <figure class=\"hub-image hub-pricing-image\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Woodex showroom and joinery display representing fit-out material selection\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"hub-caption\">Materials, services and joinery priced in one BOQ</figcaption></figure>\n    </div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "c4aa9b45eb",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hub-section hub-coordination\"><div class=\"wrap hub-coordination-grid\">\n      <figure class=\"hub-image hub-coordination-image\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Coordinated office interior with ceiling, lighting, flooring and furniture\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"hub-caption\">Every trade answers to the same programme</figcaption></figure>\n      <div class=\"hub-trade-panel\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"hub-tag\">Under one contract</p><h2>The people and trades move as one team</h2><p>No disconnected suppliers to chase. Woodex coordinates design checks, procurement, site trades and close-out under one accountable lead.</p><div class=\"hub-trade-grid\" aria-label=\"Coordinated fit-out disciplines\"><div class=\"hub-trade\">Design checks</div><div class=\"hub-trade\">Procurement</div><div class=\"hub-trade\">Civil works</div><div class=\"hub-trade\">Electrical</div><div class=\"hub-trade\">Plumbing</div><div class=\"hub-trade\">HVAC</div><div class=\"hub-trade\">Joinery</div><div class=\"hub-trade\">Furniture</div><div class=\"hub-trade\">Handover</div></div></div>\n    </div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "fa71468ece",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hub-section hub-insights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><header class=\"hub-head\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><h2>Plan the build with fewer surprises</h2><p>Short practical guides are being prepared for clients comparing scope, timing and cost.</p></header><div class=\"hub-article-grid\"><article class=\"hub-article\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"hub-article-image\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Office interior project image placeholder for fit-out guide\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"hub-article-copy\"><small>Fit-out guide</small><h3>How to read a fit-out BOQ</h3><p>What should be priced before work starts.</p><a class=\"hub-coming\" href=\"/insights/interior-design-cost-pakistan/\">Read the guide</a></div></article><article class=\"hub-article\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"hub-article-image\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" alt=\"Interior visualization project image placeholder for fit-out guide\" width=\"2240\" height=\"1120\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"hub-article-copy\"><small>Scope guide</small><h3>Fit-out or renovation?</h3><p>Choose the right starting point for the space.</p><a class=\"hub-coming\" href=\"/insights/design-process-explained/\">How we start</a></div></article><article class=\"hub-article\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"hub-article-image\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Joinery and material samples project image placeholder for budget guide\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"hub-article-copy\"><small>Budget guide</small><h3>Where fit-out cost changes</h3><p>The decisions that have the biggest effect on price.</p><a class=\"hub-coming\" href=\"/insights/interior-design-cost-pakistan/\">Read the guide</a></div></article></div></div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "4005cbb98e",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hub-section hub-dark\" id=\"fitout-hub-faq\"><div class=\"wrap hub-faq-grid\"><div class=\"hub-faq-side\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"hub-tag\">Practical answers</p><h2>Fit-Out FAQ</h2><figure class=\"hub-image hub-faq-image\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Retail interior project image placeholder accompanying fit-out questions\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"hub-caption\">Clear answers before work begins</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"faq-wrap\" data-hub-reveal=\"\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span>What is a fit-out?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>It is the construction and installation work that turns a shell or unfinished interior into a space ready to use.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Is interior design included?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>It can be. We can build from your approved drawings or provide design and fit-out together.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>How long does fit-out take?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>Office projects often take two to four weeks. Larger commercial spaces can take four to eight weeks.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Do you handle electrical and plumbing?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>Yes. Electrical, lighting, plumbing and air conditioning coordination can all sit within the scope.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Can Woodex supply furniture?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>Yes. We design, manufacture and install workstations, counters, storage and other custom pieces.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>How is the price agreed?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>An itemized BOQ is prepared after the survey, then scope and milestones are agreed before site work.</p></div></div></div>\n    </div></div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "f8253205b6",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hub-section\" id=\"fitout-hub-contact\"><div class=\"wrap hub-contact-grid\"><div class=\"hub-contact-side\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"hub-tag\">Tell us about the space</p><h2>Talk to Woodex</h2><p class=\"lead\">Share the location, area and current condition. We will help define the right fit-out scope.</p><figure class=\"hub-image hub-contact-image\"><img src=\"/assets/img/img-dce06249b137.webp\" alt=\"Woodex project exterior representing fit-out planning and delivery\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"hub-contact-details\"><p><a href=\"tel:+923224000768\">+92 322 4000768</a><br><a href=\"tel:+923214686884\">+92 321 4686884</a></p><p><a href=\"mailto:info@woodex.com.pk\">info@woodex.com.pk</a></p><p>M-71, Zainab Tower<br>Model Town Link Road, Lahore</p><p><strong>Mon-Sat 9:30-6:30</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://wa.me/923224000768\">WhatsApp Woodex →</a></p></div></div>\n      <form class=\"hub-form\" id=\"fitout-hub-form\" data-hub-reveal=\"\"><h3>Request a Fit-Out Quote</h3><div class=\"field-grid\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"hub-name\">Full Name *</label><input id=\"hub-name\" name=\"name\" required=\"\" autocomplete=\"name\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"hub-phone\">Phone Number *</label><input id=\"hub-phone\" name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" required=\"\" autocomplete=\"tel\"></div><div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"hub-email\">Email Address *</label><input id=\"hub-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" autocomplete=\"email\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"hub-sector\">Fit-Out Type *</label><select id=\"hub-sector\" name=\"sector\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\">Select one</option><option>Office</option><option>Commercial</option><option>Restaurant</option><option>Retail</option><option>Healthcare</option><option>Pharmacy</option><option>Turnkey Design Build</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"hub-location\">Location *</label><input id=\"hub-location\" name=\"location\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Area or city\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"hub-area\">Approximate Area</label><input id=\"hub-area\" name=\"area\" placeholder=\"Square feet\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"hub-budget\">Budget Range</label><select id=\"hub-budget\" name=\"budget\"><option value=\"\">Select range</option><option>Under PKR 1M</option><option>PKR 1M to 3M</option><option>PKR 3M to 6M</option><option>PKR 6M to 10M</option><option>PKR 10M+</option><option>Need guidance</option></select></div><div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"hub-details\">Project Details *</label><textarea id=\"hub-details\" name=\"details\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Current condition, rooms, services and target date\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Prepare email</button><p class=\"form-note\">Your email app will open with the brief ready to send.</p></div><p class=\"form-status\" id=\"fitout-hub-form-status\" role=\"status\">Your email app is opening with the fit-out brief.</p></form>\n    </div></section>\n  \n"
 }
]
